# Spydir UI

- Workspaces: Connect (disconnected), then Directory, Web, Pathfinder, Hygiene.
- Directory mirrors ADUC: OU tree, object list, properties tabs (General, Account, Member Of, Members, Object) plus a Spydir tab.
- Inspector is a persistent pane, not a stack of modals.
- Dense admin tool: dark zinc surfaces, one accent, severity color only on badges. No purple gradients, hero cards, or emoji decoration.
- Geometric icons for user/group/OU/computer. Do not copy Microsoft ADUC artwork.
- Jumping workspace preserves `selectedId` (Directory → Web focuses that node; findings click-through sets selection).
